package com.yet.pets.compose

import android.util.Base64

/**
 * On-device verification fixtures for the Phase 3 Android execution gate.
 *
 * Every image below was generated on the host with an independent reference
 * encoder (Pillow) and verified there before embedding:
 *
 * - PNG/JPEG/GIF via Pillow; WebP via Pillow/libwebp.
 * - `webpLossy` carries a `VP8 ` chunk (lossy), `webpLossless` a `VP8L`
 *   chunk, `webpAlpha` a `VP8X` chunk (alpha), `webpAnimated` a `VP8X`
 *   chunk plus an `ANIM` chunk (2 frames: red -> blue).
 * - `gifAnimated` is 2 frames: red -> blue.
 *
 * Pillow re-open confirmed dimensions and first-frame pixels on the host, so
 * a matching on-device decode proves the Android platform codec path, not
 * the fixture.
 */
